          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/bottle_brood.jpg",
            "title": "BROOD",
            "text": "<p>The nurtured younglings. Chamomile, lavender, frankincense, gardenia, and benzoin, wrapped in beeswax. In the hive, nurse bees tend the brood around the clock, keeping the youngest bees warm and fed. This scent holds that same comfort.</p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": "shopify://products/brood-fragrance"
          }
        },
        "column_i4LAqL": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/bottle_worker.jpg",
            "title": "WORKER",
            "text": "<p>The maiden foragers. Blood orange, grapefruit, coriander, rosemary, black pepper, labdanum, and lemongrass, grounded in beeswax. A forager bee may visit up to 5,000 flowers in a single day, carrying gifts of pollen and nectar back to the hive. This blend captures that vivid, purposeful energy.</p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": "shopify://products/worker-fragrance"
          }
        },
        "column_ipBLCT": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/bottle_drone.jpg",
            "title": "DRONE",
            "text": "<p>The male suitors. Spruce, fir, cedarwood, sweet orange, black pepper, labdanum, and tobacco, warmed by beeswax. Each season, drones take flight and mate with a queen. They are bold in their mission, driven by instinct. This scent carries that intensity,built for open air and long flights under wide skies. Alluring and unhurried, like woodsmoke and warm resin drifting through a forest.</p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": "shopify://products/drone-fragrance"
          }
        },
        "column_hiQMKT": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/bottle_queen.jpg",
            "title": "QUEEN",
            "text": "<p>The mother heart. Jasmine, gardenia, honeysuckle, rose otto, and labdanum, layered over beeswax. There is typically one queen per colony, and everything orbits around her. Lush, intoxicating, and regal, this is warm comb surrounded by a crown of flowers.</p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": "shopify://products/queen-fragrance"
          }
        }
